My bag has a lot of weight now.
I am tired.
I see a small tea stall near the road.
I go there.
I speak to the tea seller.
Hello brother, I want one cutting chai.
The vendor smiles.
He gives me hot tea.
I ask him, how much is the price?
He says, ten rupees, madam.
I have small coins.
I give him exactly ten rupees.
I hold the hot glass with my hand.
The tea is very tasty.
I drink the tea slowly.
There is a lot of crowd in the market.
I watch all the people.
Now I am happy.
